Subject: [PATCH] SCM export: RN QoS, areas prisma-browser + iam, migration
 checklist

- remote-networks: qos-profiles (folder Remote Networks) before bandwidth-allocations (RN files 05-07 renumbered)
- prisma-browser area (api.sase /seb-api/v1, cursor pagination): user / device groups, applications,
  application groups / plugins, sign-in / access-and-data / security / customization policy, pending changes
- iam area (api.sase /iam/v1, documentation only): roles, custom roles, permission sets, service accounts,
  access policies (+ access-policies.csv template), permissions
- optional endpoints: HTTP 401/403/404 -> status unavailable (not an error)
- migration_checklist in manifest + MIGRATION_CHECKLIST.md (license, secrets, certificates, new IPs, ZTNA,
  explicit proxy, CIE / logging, Prisma Browser publish, IAM, push)
- connector: absolute URLs in getSCMResourceAll(), getCursorResourceAll(); manifest format_version 5
- wrappers scm_pb_export.php, scm_iam_export.php

